<title>UK: Ghana buys 25,000 tonnes gas oil for Jan - trade.</title>
<headline>Ghana buys 25,000 tonnes gas oil for Jan - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ghana has awarded Mobil a tender for 25,000 tonnes of gas oil in January, traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>The cargo is for delivery between January 15-20 into Tema port west of Accra with a specification of maximum 1.1 percent sulphur content, they said.</p>
<p>Traders described the delivery as a spot transaction outside Ghana's regular tender programme.</p>
